07373251041_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iLHQqnt3QnUQ7kNvwEYhxSQ&_nc_oc=Adk5G2A1ipTWaS5n1XO8Sd9qnWMH-S-nIv8jEfmArDWSjvpVNWARnd_FgUMrInjQUq4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzY8qyaI6Xjkzspsx4FHHpP0kkgIPXDh-He87H0ZgGZOw&oe=69BD4965"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Screenshot_2024-04-20_162603_1.png", "id": "458062533404629", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75322602_458062540071295_8789285073392193674_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1X7KuhMHkNkQ7kNvwGM4CGi&_nc_oc=AdmxNc5oXJkVMZ7ES0rgivdGto3KcbD18h5PMooP-kfGmSHdn1aW-LT81N64dNnd2_U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzuOx2wpcCi785CZLZFugxRHlEdSNal-0DzYu2M_LYX_w&oe=69BD4077"}, "display_name": "Level scary!", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# Level Scary: A Gorilla Tag Fan Game\n\n**Level Scary** is an immersive VR horror game inspired by the popular **Gorilla Tag**. Currently in **beta**, this fan game takes the familiar mechanics of Gorilla Tag and adds a terrifying twist.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Playable Model**: Experience the game with a detailed and responsive play model.\n- **Working Mods**: Enhance your gameplay with various mods that introduce new elements of fear.\n- **Vent System**: Navigate through a network of vents, adding to the suspenseful atmosphere.\n- **Multiplayer Servers**: Join friends or face the horror alone in a thrilling multiplayer setting.\n\n## Gameplay\n\nPlayers navigate through dark, eerie environments filled with unexpected scares and challenging obstacles. The game features a detailed play model, working mods, and a network of vents that add to the suspenseful atmosphere.\n\n## Beta Phase\n\nAs **Level Scary** is currently in beta, players can experience the core gameplay while providing valuable feedback for future improvements.\n\n---\n\nDive into **Level Scary** and test your nerves in this spine-chilling VR experience that pushes the boundaries of traditional Gorilla Tag gameplay.\n{469350875616633}", "short_description": "\"Level Scary\" is a beta VR horror game inspired by Gorilla Tag. This fan game features a playable model, functional mods, vents, and servers for a thrilling multiplayer experience."}]}, "developer_name": "Aden Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://prutuo.github.io/AdenPrivacyPolicy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Aden Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://levelscary.github.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26027167736874646"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031425_2153501971670023_8360728130633927716_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IBOYFY9tA-EQ7kNvwFSH_Sm&_nc_oc=Adl8UAOnaYZ2dKfygUZy7pSa_pHV4NzenMJqH0F7QWBvihtWlAVKFXprhpH_dCHPcbI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfySE1AcX71G9e-Y3ES0XdDHXDUlL6YtluPO_mMq2tHsGw&oe=69BD2F13"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Level scary!", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Action", "id": "459781504968480"}], "release_date": 1718923389, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "